  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.07",
    "summary": "A unit with at least one model carrying a [CLOSE-QUARTERS] weapon may use the Close-Quarters Shooting type (10.06). Under any other shooting type, each of the unit's models other than MONSTER and VEHICLE models must choose between its [CLOSE-QUARTERS] weapons and its other ranged weapons, using one or more from one set only. The printed [PISTOL] entry (24.27) declares [PISTOL] the same ability as [CLOSE-QUARTERS].",
